plies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfhBYrFFOtR","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfhBYrFFOtR","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T09:34:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfhBYFglEP7","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfhBYFglEP7","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"27 吋閨蜜機不只能推著走！OVO TT6 的螢幕可拆下、換桌面支架，接遊戲機或當筆電副螢幕，使用情境多了不少。這篇從組裝、觸控到影音表現實際開箱，搬上桌後有哪些細節要留意？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-09T09:34:53.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":8,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DfjC2P7k7pv","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfjC2P7k7pv","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"新的 Claude Fable 重置券規則有點複雜\n和以往的重置券很不一樣！\n用已知的資料整理一下：\n\n1. 大家拿到的數量不一樣\n→ Pro、Team Standard：1 張\nMax、Ultra、Team Premium 看訂閱多久\n→  未滿 6 個月 1 張\n→  6 到 12 個月 2 張\n→  超過 12 個月 3 張\n\n2. 期限\n台北時間 2027/3/9 下午 3:59 前要用完\n\n3. Fable 重置券怎麼重置？\n→  5 小時額度整條補滿\n→  每週額度只退回 Fable 用掉的那一份\n其他模型用掉的，不會一起 reset\n\n建議不要太急著用掉！\nweekly limit 到底怎麼補、有沒有災情\n可以等更多使用心得出來後再評估怎麼用","timestamp":"2026-11-10T04:26:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":105,"replies":22,"reposts":3,"shares":113},"score":158,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T21:09:10+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhYW_OH8o_","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfhYW_OH8o_","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"我的 reset 勒！\n\nGrok Bot 近期傳出使用量劇增的情況\n雖然沒有明顯感受到\n\nLine 群組裡面朋友們把它玩的咪咪冒冒也還夠\n但發 reset 就是讚，有用的朋友們可以看看是否收到了","timestamp":"2026-11-09T12:55:42.000Z","stats":{"likes":10,"replies":5,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":20,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfe_a1BH9tN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Dfe_a1BH9tN","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"圖文版上架囉！","timestamp":"2026-11-08T14:39:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfb1JjoHznL","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Dfb1JjoHznL","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Line 群組裡面有個 Grok Bot 真的超方便\n\nBot 可以做到：\n- 詢問大家方便聚餐的時間\n- 找餐廳給大家選\n- 選好餐廳後直接打開 inline 或 Open Table 網頁訂位\n- 訂完位之後就順便建立行事曆\n- 把行事曆連結丟回到群組\n\n以前還要有個人當主揪\n現在直接把主揪丟給 AI 來當就好","timestamp":"2026-11-07T09:11:50.000Z","stats":{"likes":269,"replies":31,"reposts":22,"shares":194},"score":397,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[{"id":"DfeH9LAG9Cx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DfeH9LAG9Cx","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"iPhone手機複製，Mac 直接貼上。\n中間不用傳給Line了！！\n​\n這個功能叫「通用剪貼板」，\n跟 AirDrop 一樣是蘋果內建的互通功能，\n文字、圖片都能直接過去。\n​\n◼︎ 設定兩步\n① iPhone：設定 → 一般 → AirPlay 與接續互動 → 打開 Handoff\n② Mac：系統設定 → 一般 → AirDrop 與接續互動 → 打開接續互動\n​\n◼︎ 記得\n✅ 兩台登入同一個 Apple ID\n✅ 藍牙、Wi-Fi 都要開","timestamp":"2026-11-08T06:34:39.000Z","stats":{"likes":115,"replies":15,"reposts":15,"shares":235},"score":190,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfgiXgflA-H","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DfgiXgflA-H","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"但如果需要多則常用訊息存成快捷！可以使用CopyNow的快捷卡片+鍵盤⌨️\n更方便管理！\napps.apple.com/us/ap…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T05:03:55.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-10T05:14:20+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}